sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / DSP API
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant WC as workflow-controller<br/>9090/TCP metrics
    participant Pod as Workflow Pod
    participant AE as argoexec<br/>(emissary executor)
    participant S3 as Artifact Store<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL<br/>5432/TCP or 3306/TCP

    Note over User,DB: Flow 1: Workflow Execution

    User->>K8sAPI: POST Workflow CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>WC: Informer notification<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    WC->>K8sAPI: Create Pod for workflow step<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>Pod: Pod scheduled and started

    Note over AE,S3: Init Container Phase
    AE->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>Auth: IAM / Secret credentials

    Note over Pod,AE: Main Container Execution
    Pod->>Pod: Execute user container<br/>(entrypoint replaced by argoexec)

    Note over AE,S3: Wait/Sidecar Phase
    AE->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>Auth: IAM / Secret credentials
    AE->>K8sAPI: Patch WorkflowTaskResult CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    K8sAPI-->>WC: TaskResult informer notification
    WC->>K8sAPI: Update Workflow status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over WC,DB: Flow 2: Workflow Archival (optional)

    WC->>DB: Archive completed workflow<br/>Auth: Secret credentials<br/>Encryption: SSL (configurable)
    WC->>K8sAPI: Delete completed Workflow CR<br/>(if configured)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
